From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: theycallmeboxy <82409831+theycallmeboxy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:44:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] panvk/csf: skip the deferred timestamp walk when no timestamp
 was deferred

Every render pass ends with a walk of the deferred timestamp query list on
all three subqueues, a few memory round trips each, even when the pass wrote
no timestamp. Only walk when this command buffer deferred a timestamp in the
pass, executed secondaries, or the pass may hold timestamps deferred elsewhere
(resumed or inherited render pass, secondary command buffer).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAYrqSPd4TgpVaKLqz5cYR

Purpose: skip the per-render-pass walk of the deferred timestamp query list on all three subqueues when no timestamp was deferred
Upstream-commit: none (generic PanVK CSF; upstream candidate)
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (Anbernic RG477M, Dimensity 8300, v11)
Tested Kbase UAPI: CSF 1.21 / MediaTek
Dependencies: none
Validation test: drawbench loadpasses ~5% faster on its own; with csf-v11/190 see there; PanProbe 38/38
Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_buffer.c |  4 ++++
 src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c   | 13 +++++++++++++
 src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_query.c  |  6 ++++--
 src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_cmd_draw.h          |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_buffer.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_buffer.c
index 952aad9..b47583f 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_buffer.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_buffer.c
@@ -1279,6 +1279,10 @@ panvk_per_arch(CmdExecuteCommands)(VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer,
     * secondary command buffers. */
    flush_sync_points(primary);
 
+   /* Secondaries inside a render pass can defer timestamp queries to its
+    * end. */
+   primary->state.gfx.render.has_deferred_ts = true;
+
    for (uint32_t i = 0; i < commandBufferCount; i++) {
       VK_FROM_HANDLE(panvk_cmd_buffer, secondary, pCommandBuffers[i]);
 
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
index 4e65eb1..b7c8afe 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
@@ -7274,6 +7274,19 @@ handle_deferred_queries(struct panvk_cmd_buffer *cmdbuf)
 {
    struct panvk_device *dev = to_panvk_device(cmdbuf->vk.base.device);
 
+   /* Walking the deferred timestamp list costs a few memory round trips per
+    * subqueue on every render pass. Skip it unless this command buffer
+    * deferred a timestamp, or the pass may hold timestamps deferred
+    * elsewhere (resumed or inherited render pass, secondary command buffer).
+    */
+   if (!cmdbuf->state.gfx.render.has_deferred_ts &&
+       !(cmdbuf->state.gfx.render.flags & VK_RENDERING_RESUMING_BIT) &&
+       !inherits_render_ctx(cmdbuf) &&
+       cmdbuf->vk.level == VK_COMMAND_BUFFER_LEVEL_PRIMARY)
+      return;
+
+   cmdbuf->state.gfx.render.has_deferred_ts = false;
+
    for (uint32_t sq = 0; sq < PANVK_SUBQUEUE_COUNT; ++sq) {
       struct cs_builder *b = panvk_get_cs_builder(cmdbuf, sq);
       struct cs_index current = cs_scratch_reg64(b, 0);
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_query.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_query.c
index d95ab58..5b3029a 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_query.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_query.c
@@ -582,10 +582,12 @@ panvk_cmd_write_timestamp_query(struct panvk_cmd_buffer *cmd,
    const bool defer =
       in_rp && (write_sq_mask & BITFIELD_BIT(PANVK_SUBQUEUE_FRAGMENT));
 
-   if (defer)
+   if (defer) {
       panvk_cs_defer_timestamp(cmd, stage, pool, query);
-   else
+      cmd->state.gfx.render.has_deferred_ts = true;
+   } else {
       panvk_cs_write_timestamp(cmd, stage, pool, query);
+   }
 
    panvk_cs_write_ts_info(cmd, stage, pool, query);
 
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_cmd_draw.h b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_cmd_draw.h
index 9943277..f6d6a2d 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_cmd_draw.h
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_cmd_draw.h
@@ -53,6 +53,8 @@ struct panvk_resolve_attachment {
 
 struct panvk_rendering_state {
    VkRenderingFlags flags;
+   /* A timestamp query was deferred to the end of the render pass. */
+   bool has_deferred_ts;
    uint32_t layer_count;
    uint32_t view_mask;
    enum u_tristate first_provoking_vertex;
